(UPDATE_CONFIG_HOOK), so --host=klausscpu-buildroot-linux-musl works
for all of them.

--- a/support/gnuconfig/config.sub	2026-11-10 18:49:16.739867972 +0200
+++ b/support/gnuconfig/config.sub	2026-11-10 18:49:16.741454800 +0200
@@ -1207,6 +1207,7 @@
 			| i370 | i*86 | i860 | i960 | ia16 | ia64 \
 			| ip2k | iq2000 \
 			| k1om \
+			| klausscpu \
 			| kvx \
 			| le32 | le64 \
 			| lm32 \
